Minimal SFG/DFG Nangles regression test
=======================================

Purpose
-------
Smoke-test `make_sfg_dfg.x` with:

- tiny CI space (1 valence + 2 core roots),
- short trajectory (`n_step=200`),
- phase grid `N1=N2=3`,
- `Nangles=2` polarization points on the sphere.

What is compared
----------------
`compare.sh` checks, against files in `ref/`:

1. `out/field_mag.dat`
2. `out/polarization_components.dat`
3. `out/pol_0/run_opt_0_x_0/mu_t_pp.dat`

How to run
----------
```bash
cd WaveT/tests/SFG_DFG/test_Nangles
export WAVET_PROGRAM_PATH=$(cd ../../../bin && pwd)
module purge
module load slurm intel-2024.2.0/intel_Comps-2024.2 \
            intel-2024.2.0/intel_MPI-2024.2 intel-2024.2.0/intel_MKL-2024.2
export OMP_NUM_THREADS=1
export I_MPI_FABRICS=shm:ofi
make
cat test_report.txt
```

It is also run automatically when you `make` from `WaveT/tests/` or
`WaveT/tests/SFG_DFG/`.
